      "difficulty": 3,
      "sections": [
        "Is he your grandpa?",
        "确认家人关系"
      ],
      "core_concept": "指着别人确认关系：Is he your grandpa?（他是你的爷爷吗？）肯定回答 Yes, he is.（完整形式）；否定回答 No, he isn't.（isn't = is not）。问女生用 Is she…? 回答 Yes, she is. / No, she isn't.。和 Unit 3 的 Are you…? 一样，肯定回答要用完整形式。",
      "key_formula": "Is he your…? → Yes, he is. ／ No, he isn't.（isn't = is not）",
      "common_mistakes": [
        "肯定回答缩写成 Yes, he's（错误，要完整）",
        "否定回答写成 No, he not",
        "he/she 用反"
      ],
      "tips": "对比记：Are you…?→Yes, I am.／Is he…?→Yes, he is.——回答都要用完整形式。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "difficulty": 2,
          "question": "—Is he your grandpa? —______（是的）",
          "options": [
            "Yes, he is.",
