            "Yes, he are."
          ],
          "answer": "A",
          "explanation": "肯定回答用完整形式 Yes, he is.。"
        },
        {
          "type": "choice",
          "difficulty": 2,
          "question": "—Is she your mother? —______（不是）",
          "options": [
            "No, she isn't.",
